        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Władysław Grydziuszko\n- Ships: Tama Maru No. 2\n- Companies: Douglas Aircraft\n- Products: American naval scout plane, Curtiss SB2C Helldiver\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- Władysław Grydziuszko was a sergeant, not a general.\n- The war involving Władysław Grydziuszko was World War II.\n- Tama Maru No. 2 was damaged during World War II by an American naval scout plane and a dive bomber.\n- Douglas Aircraft manufactured the American naval scout plane.\n- The Curtiss SB2C Helldiver replaced that American naval scout plane.",
